This program is based on emlearn in ~/PAPER/HI

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%% main functions
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
main_learn_aspect.m 
  --> learn aspect from all sessions

main.m / main_beta.m
  --> Leave one out, learn aspect from all but except for one session --> estimate interests from pre-part of the session --> predict item-of-interest / region-of-interests
  beta: using Gaussian for center bias

main_comparison.m
  --> make comparison data, using collaborative filtering for attribute values


